-- ReplicatedStorage/Misc/Blocks.luau
--!strict

-- SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for every block: id + appearance + behaviour. Adding a
-- block is one entry in `defs`. WorldGen, the mesher, editing and the UI all read
-- from here — nothing else hardcodes block data.
--
-- TEXTURES are not entered here. `Misc/BlockTextures` is generated by
-- tools/textures/upload.js and applied over these defs further down; a block with
-- no entry renders as flat colour + material, which is a perfectly good look and
-- much better than a placeholder. `tools/textures/WANTED.md` lists what's missing.

